## Status markers

| Marker | Meaning |
|---|---|
| 🔴 Open | not started or in progress |
| 🟡 Partial | part shipped, remainder listed under **Remaining** |
| 🔵 External | waiting on a third party (store review, provider approval, vendor) |
| 🧪 Smoke pending | code done, live/smoke evidence missing |
| ⏸️ Deferred | intentionally parked; reason in **Decision/blocker** |
| ✅ Done | closed, evidence in **Last evidence**; moves to archive |
| 🟢 Live | shipped and observed in production |
| 🔬 Research | discovery only, output goes to `{{REPORTS_DIR}}/` |
| ℹ️ Info | not a task; a pinned fact or policy |

