## Who may do what?

Every open item carries one tag:

- `[{{LABEL_HUMAN_ONLY}}]` — only {{HUMAN_GATEKEEPER}} may do the remaining step: destructive or structural data changes, deleting data, changing auth or billing, unresolved architectural decisions, anything with a real-money or legal consequence.
- `[{{LABEL_ANYONE}}]` — anyone, including an AI agent, may do it end to end.

Rules: the tag reflects the **remaining** work, not the whole scope. When unsure, `[{{LABEL_HUMAN_ONLY}}]`. An item may be escalated mid-flight when a destructive need appears. Closed items carry no tag.

